{"id":"00180","root":"uni00180_1","name":{"ja":"ミーティア","en":"Metier"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ミーティア","en":"Metier"},"aliases":["Meetia"],"element":"Spiritual","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":[],"release":"2019-04-15","limited":true,"characterId":142,"profile":{"ja":"魔界育ちでリリム、ミレイユ同様に夢魔である。リリムとは違い仕事をしっかり行う夢魔。ミレイユもミーティアの事を認めており、仲は良好である。彼女に狙われた男性は確実に衰退し、死に絶えてしまうくらい男の方から彼女に魅了され求めてしまうのである。彼女に対しては魔界、人間界関係なく依頼が飛び込んでくるくらい、引っ張りだこである。今回は人間界の任務のついでにリリムを捜索ししっかり仕事をしているか監視してほしいとミレイユに頼まれ彼女を捜しに行くのであった。ミレイユとリリムは犬猿の仲であり、自由奔放に生きているリリムをミレイユはよく思っておらず、ミーティアはそこはリリムの魅力だからと説得はしているが、彼女には優しく庇ってもリリムの為にならないと怒られてしまう。","en":"Metier was raised in the Demon Realm and, like Lilim and Mireille, is a succubus. Unlike Lilim, she is a diligent worker. Mireille also acknowledges Metier, and the two get along well. Men who fall under her gaze inevitably wither and die, utterly captivated by her. She is in such demand that contracts pour in from both the Demon Realm and the Human Realm. This time, Mireille asked her to locate Lilim while on a Human Realm mission, to make sure Lilim is doing her job properly. Mireille and Lilim have a cat-and-dog relationship; Mireille disapproves of Lilim's free-spirited lifestyle, while Metier tries to persuade her that Lilim's charm lies in that very freedom, only to be rebuked for shielding Lilim too gently."},"illustrator":"ほかん","voiceActor":"月村美空","forms":[{"id":"uni00180_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[145,290],"def":[105,210],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["3","160001"],"evolve":[["evo00007",5],["evo00008",15],["evo00009",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00180_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[230,230],"atk":[225,450],"def":[145,290],"spd":[82,82],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["3","160001","160002"],"evolve":[["evo00008",10],["evo00009",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00180_3","rarity":6,"r